# RvKernel

SukiSU Ultra v4.2.0 (40900) integrated.

## Build

Use AOSP Clang r574158 with Polly support.

```sh
export CLANG_DIR=/path/to/clang-r574158
export PATH="$CLANG_DIR/bin:$PATH"
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="$CLANG_DIR/lib${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}"
export LD_PRELOAD="$CLANG_DIR/lib/libLLVM.so"
make O=out ARCH=arm64 LLVM=1 LLVM_IAS=1 vendor/xiaomi/alioth_defconfig
make O=out -j"$(nproc)" ARCH=arm64 LLVM=1 LLVM_IAS=1 Image dtbs dtbo.img dtb.img
```
